{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285830/extras/ShortGame_resized.gif?t=1629082579\" /><br><br>Estimated play time: 15-20 minutes.<br><br>Please note that this game deals with depression, self-harm and suicidal ideation. Player discretion is advised.<br><br><i>Please Hold Me</i> is an interactive friend that really needs you. Meet Olivier, a lonely man that is in dire need of a new friend. You will be able to talk with him about a variety of different topics and forge a meaningful bond with him.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285830/extras/SteamGif-resize.gif?t=1629082579\" /><br><br><i>Please Hold Me</i> is a small experimental game about the true meaning of being empathetic. It was developed with the intent of rethinking how we interact with conversations in video games. The non-linear dialog systems does not work with the usual structure used in such systems and create unpredictable conversations for the player. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A new and innovative dialog system<br></li><li> Over fifty topics of discussion<br></li><li> Hand-drawn graphics<br></li><li> Raw emotions<br></li><li> Achievements!<br></li><li> Choice driven dialog<br></li><li> Multiple endings and secrets</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1285830?t=1629082579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1629082579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1629082579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1629082579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes mention of suicide, self-harm and mental illnesses."},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285830/extras/ShortGame_resized.gif?t=1629082579\" /><br><br>Estimated play time: 15-20 minutes.<br><br>Please note that this game deals with depression, self-harm and suicidal ideation. Player discretion is advised.<br><br><i>Please Hold Me</i> is an interactive friend that really needs you. Meet Olivier, a lonely man that is in dire need of a new friend. You will be able to talk with him about a variety of different topics and forge a meaningful bond with him.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285830/extras/SteamGif-resize.gif?t=1629082579\" /><br><br><i>Please Hold Me</i> is a small experimental game about the true meaning of being empathetic. It was developed with the intent of rethinking how we interact with conversations in video games. The non-linear dialog systems does not work with the usual structure used in such systems and create unpredictable conversations for the player. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A new and innovative dialog system<br></li><li> Over fifty topics of discussion<br></li><li> Hand-drawn graphics<br></li><li> Raw emotions<br></li><li> Achievements!<br></li><li> Choice driven dialog<br></li><li> Multiple endings and secrets</li></ul>","developers":["byolivierb"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285830/header.jpg?t=1629082579","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OSX</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256780781,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256780781/movie480.mp4?t=1586839213","max":"http://video.akamai.ste